# 🔹 Gin Framework Example

Install Gin:

```bash
go get github.com/gin-gonic/gin
```

Example:

```go
package main

import "github.com/gin-gonic/gin"

func main() {

    router := gin.Default()

    router.GET("/", func(c *gin.Context) {
        c.JSON(200, gin.H{
            "message": "Welcome to Gin API",
        })
    })

    router.Run(":8080")
}
```

